(When I opened the door to the club room, a few club members were sitting inside.)
<<show pyo_smile>>
<<play pyo_sound>>
(In one corner, I saw EunPyo quietly smiling while looking at her laptop.)
{name()}: EunPyo, what are you doing?
(Startled, EunPyo quickly closed her laptop screen.)
<<show pyo_shock>>
<<play 서은표_허>>
EunPyo: Oh?! Uh, it's nothing!
{name()}: You looked really focused just now. What were you watching?
<<show pyo_blush>>
EunPyo: ...I was just booking tickets for the new 'Dol-Se-Ah-Ttae' movie.
<<if get("otk") >= 4>>
    <<jump 주3_수_3교시_동아리방_서은표_씹덕력4이상_영문>>
<<else>>
    <<jump 주3_수_3교시_동아리방_서은표_씹덕력4미만_영문>>
<<endif>>
===

title: 주3_수_3교시_동아리방_서은표_씹덕력4이상_영문
---
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
{name()}: Oh, I saw the trailer for that.
{name()}: I actually cried watching the ending of Season 2.
<<show pyo_shock>>
EunPyo: R-really? 
EunPyo: I loved Season 2 so much too...
<<show pyo_blush>>
EunPyo: So I'm planning to see the movie. 
<<choice 주3_수_3교시_동아리방_서은표_긍정1_영문 "Sounds good." 주3_수_3교시_동아리방_서은표_부정1_영문 "How can you watch something like that in a theater??">>
EunPyo: Uh... would you... like to go see it with me?
===

title: 주3_수_3교시_동아리방_서은표_긍정1_영문
---
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
{name()}: Sounds good.
{name()}: When are you free? When were you booking it for? Let me see.
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: Okay. Hang on a sec...
(EunPyo opened her laptop again.)
(We coordinated our schedules and booked seats next to each other.)
<<jump 주3_수_3교시_동아리방_서은표_분기1_영문>>
